/data/vision/
/ScrewdriverAndWrench.v5-v2.coco-segmentation(1)/
/ScrewdriverAndWrench.v5-v2.coco-segmentation(1).zip

# Per-cell physical-motion approval pose. Keep only the reviewed template in Git.
